  "objectives": [
    {
      "text": "The funding for the LearnActive project was canceled by the project creator on March 24, 2022.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding period for the LearnActive project was from February 26, 2022, to March 28, 2022.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LearnActive aims to provide a unique way for individuals to find the perfect sports instructor for their needs.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Independent instructors often have to promote their services themselves or seek clients at lifts.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The LearnActive project had a funding goal of $70,614.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Independent instructors are forced to promote their services themselves or look for clients right at the lifts.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Most independent instructors are professionals in sports, not in advertising and social media marketing.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attracting customers for independent instructors is expensive, and their working hours are not always fully loaded.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Working at sports and fitness academies and delegating client acquisition and administrative tasks is an alternative for instructors.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Customers are difficult to come by for sports and fitness academies.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attracting a client costs anywhere from 20% to 50% of the lesson's final cost due to strong competition for lessons at resorts.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Up to 50% of the lesson's expense is spent on marketing.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Customer retention among skiers and snowboarders is low because they prefer to travel to different destinations.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "No resort or institution can cut the expense of recruiting clients alone on its own.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The website and app are popular as a job search tool for instructors and as an active hobby community for sports enthusiasts.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The website and app serve as a source of inspiration for people's own fitness goals.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project will support a wide range of sports including climbing, surfing, skateboarding, and basketball.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The website and app are popular as a job search tool for instructors and as a hobby community for sports enthusiasts.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The platform supports a wide range of sports including climbing, surfing, skateboarding, and basketball.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LearnActive is an active lifestyle enabler that delivers greater convenience and more choice for active sports instructors and people looking to learn new activities.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LearnActive helps users find the perfect instructor for their sports activities.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "For sports instructors, LearnActive is a way to find new clients for their work.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The challenges will not affect the mission to connect individuals to instructors all over the world.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The mission is to make it easy for anyone to learn any active sport they want without having to take unnecessary risks.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The platform aims to connect individuals to instructors all over the world.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The platform allows anyone to learn any active sport they want.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
