      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Customers are difficult to come by for sports and fitness academies.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sports and fitness academies are good at scheduling multi-day group training courses.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Loading instructors for the rest of the day becomes challenging for sports and fitness academies.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attracting a client costs anywhere from 20% to 50% of the lesson's final cost due to strong competition for lessons at resorts.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Up to 50% of the lesson's expense is spent on marketing.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Customer retention among skiers and snowboarders is low because they prefer to travel to different destinations.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "No resort or institution can cut the expense of recruiting clients alone on its own.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LearnActive helps users find the perfect instructor for their sports activities.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "For sports instructors, LearnActive is a way to find new clients for their work.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LearnActive has a website available at https://www.learnactive.me/.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There are risks and challenges associated with starting a new business.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Key risks and challenges include developing a platform that is easy to use and meets the needs of both instructors and users.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Building a user base for the platform is a key challenge.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Developing relationships with instructors and getting them on board with the platform is a key challenge.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Competing with other platforms that offer similar services is a key challenge.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The platform faces competition from other platforms that offer similar services.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The absence of the platform alone is considered a risk.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt94__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    }
  ]
}